5. TESTING AND CI
-----------------

tests/
    Unit, API, benchmark, documentation, notebook, and scientific-contract tests.

.github/workflows/newapi.yml
    Routine acceptance gate running the full test suite, controlled clean
    scientific battery, and diagnostic method comparison.

.github/workflows/extended-benchmarks.yml
    Path-scoped/manual extended validation that smoke-tests the benchmark front
    ends, then executes fixed-noise controlled, clean sampling-robustness, and
    observation-noise robustness studies and preserves their JSON artifacts.
